# Files that only exist on your machine, such as editor or tool settings, do not belong here.
# Ignore them in your own clone with .git/info/exclude, or for every repository with a global
# ignore file set by `git config --global core.excludesFile ~/.gitignore_global`.
# Neither is committed, so this file only lists what the project itself creates.

